<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 392 0 R
/E (On 25th August 2023, 40 Semester 7 students visited the Automation CoE \(Bosch Rexroth\) at Ganpat University. This center simulates smart factory environments with PLCs, robotics, and pneumatic systems. Students worked on real-time automation simulations and saw industrial robots in action. The visit enhanced their understanding of Automated Manufacturing through Industry 4.0 tools. It inspired many to consider automation as a future specialization. The visit was guided by Dr. N. A. Patel and Prof. D. K. Patel.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
